[Ci]) and [X] as in "ugh".

If [C] is not permissible (after all I didn't see it documented 
anywhere): The hairball feeling goes away if you grind your teeth at the 
same time :O). Seriously, it isn't necessary to open your jaws. One 
movement less, and it all flows natchully, don't it?

